      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a concise guide for the initial setup steps of the VortexScale deployment engine on a standard Linux environment:\n\nTo start using VortexScale, follow these steps:\n\n1. Download the `vortex-cli` binary from our internal repository.\n2. Make the binary executable by running `chmod +x vortex-cli`.\n3. Add the `vortex-cli` directory to your system's path by running `export PATH=$PATH:~/.vortex-cli`.\n4. Perform an initial bootstrap using `vortex init`.\n\nStart deploying with VortexScale!",
